<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech March real PPI +0.2 pct mo/mo, 4.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech March real PPI +0.2 pct mo/mo, 4.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real industrial producer prices were 0.2 percent higher in March, putting prices 4.3 percent higher than in the same month in 1996, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The CSU added that March real construction prices, based on estimates, rose 1.2 percent, month-on-month, putting the year-on-year rate at 10.9 percent.</p>
</text>
